  "question": {
    "text": "Suppose the elements P and Q combine to form two compounds  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>  and  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> . When 0.1 mole of  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>  weight 10 g and 0.05 mole of  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>  weight 9 g, the atomic weights of P and Q are"
  },
